NOTE ON THE PROPOSAL TEXT
================================================================================

The DAO proposal that funded this template described the repository as "MIT".
The actual licensing is the structure above: MIT for original work, Apache-2.0
for the two directories derived from upstream Apache-2.0 sources. The deviation
is intentional and is disclosed rather than silently relabelled, because
relabelling Apache-2.0 code as MIT would be a licence violation.

================================================================================
NOTE ON THE INVISIBLE-UX MODULE
================================================================================

The upstream sources contain an invisible-UX (session-key) authentication
module. This public template deliberately does NOT ship that implementation;
player-facing actions are authenticated by the transaction sender. See
docs/invisible-ux-boundaries.md for the rationale, what exactly is and is not
included, and how to plug in an alternative authentication strategy.

